B.aIi=s(["Not yet scholar-reviewed. No named scholar has reviewed this app yet. We check every citation we can, we say so when we cannot, and we will name a reviewer here only once one has agreed to be named."],t.s)
B.aZj=new A.af("Review status",B.aIi)
B.aAa=s(["The Arabic is the Tanzil Uthmani text bundled in the app and shown exactly as supplied. Qur\u2019an is never quoted from memory, and never produced by an AI.","The English is Saheeh International, as supplied by Tanzil, with its own punctuation. It is a translation of the meaning, not the Qur\u2019an itself."],t.s)
B.aZb=new A.af("The Qur\u2019an",B.aAa)
B.aN6=s(["We draw on the six books (Kutub al-Sittah). Sahih al-Bukhari and Sahih Muslim are cited by book and number.","Abu Dawud, at-Tirmidhi, an-Nasa\u2019i and Ibn Majah are shown with the grade and who gave it. Their grades differ between scholars, so we never show a bare \u201csahih\u201d.","Anything outside the six must name the text it comes from, or it is labelled, or it is removed. If a citation cannot be checked we drop the number and the grade and say it is \u201creported\u201d."],t.s)
B.aZy=new A.af("Hadith",B.aN6)
B.auj=s(["Qur\u2019an \xb7 Hadith (with grade and grader) \xb7 Seerah report \xb7 Scholarly explanation \xb7 Reflection \xb7 Disputed in the sources.","A reflection is our own thinking and is not evidence. Where scholars differ we say that they differ."],t.s)
B.aZh=new A.af("Labels you will see",B.auj)
B.auy=s(["Accounts from before the Qur\u2019an era, and material from the People of the Book, sit apart and carry the badge \u201cNot from the Qur\u2019an\u201d.","We sort them in three: confirmed by our sources; silent, where we neither believe nor disbelieve (Sahih al-Bukhari 4485); and contradicted, which we leave out. Relating such accounts is permitted (Sahih al-Bukhari 3461)."],t.s)
B.aYY=new A.af("Earlier accounts",B.auy)
B.ao6=s(["A ruling names the published scholar or fatwa body it comes from. Without one, we say \u201cask a scholar\u201d. The app does not issue fatwas, and an AI answer is never a fatwa."],t.s)
B.aYA=new A.af("Rulings",B.ao6)
B.aqE=s(["No image of any prophet appears anywhere in Ar-Rayaan, in any screen, card or lesson."],t.s)
B.aYJ=new A.af("No images of prophets",B.aqE)
B.avk=s([B.aZj,B.aZb,B.aZy,B.aZh,B.aYY,B.aYA,B.aYJ],t.BC)
