B.Ha=s(["Still no verified answer on whether that is permitted, and I will not guess: it depends on the details and on your school. Our Sources lists a qualified scholar, and the buttons below go to the closest place in the app.","I cannot answer that ruling from verified texts. A qualified scholar who knows the details is the right person; Our Sources lists one, and your local masjid can help too. Search is below if you want to look for the topic itself.","That one is beyond my shelf, and a ruling is not mine to guess. Please take it to a qualified scholar. Our Sources is the first button below, and the second goes to the closest place in the app."],t.s)
B.Hb=s(["I am sorry, that is a painful thing to go through, and feeling broken does not mean you are failing. Allah says: \u201cFor indeed, with hardship [will be] ease.\u201d (Qur'an 94:5). Be gentle with yourself and lean on someone you trust. A question about the ruling on a divorce depends on your own situation, so please take it to a scholar; I will not guess at it. Sakina is a quiet page here if you want somewhere to sit with this."],t.s)
