B.aaE=new A.ch("Whoever fasts Ramadan out of faith and hope for reward, his previous sins are forgiven.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 38",null,null)
B.aax=new A.ch("Whoever prays the two cool hours (Fajr and Asr) will enter Paradise.","Abu Musa al-Ash\u2019ari (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 574",null,null)
B.a9X=new A.ch("The closest a servant is to his Lord is while he is prostrating \u2014 so make much dua.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 482",null,null)
